00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:48.615
He refused

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:51.051
for 3 hours to tell the mob to leave.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.685
There has never been a greater

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.021
